     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Can lavaan output the degrees of freedom from the model statement <i>before</i> it runs a model? </div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
